# Cursor rules (pointer)

Authoritative Flutter + NocoDB rules live in **`.cursor/rules/flutter_expert.mdc`** (always applied), including **§9 LAW OF THE MAIN THREAD** (100ms UI feedback, zero-await before shadow state, no blocking STT/Wear/cleanup on record path).

**Mandatory for ALL database (NocoDB) work and ALL related layout tasks:** follow **`NOCODB_MANIFEST.md`** at the repo root together with **`lib/DATA_MAP.md`**. Do not invent alternate URL shapes, link payloads, or parsing behavior; update the manifest first if the stack changes.

Architecture high-level contracts (including main-thread law) are in **`ARCHITECTURE.md`**.
